{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130930/extras/324d04de8def30cd9d1797be02a9a729.avif?t=1761750149\" width=1200 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Golarion is yours for the taking in <i><strong>Munchkin Pathfinder</strong></i>, bringing the iconic characters, classes, and monsters of Paizo\u2019s <i>Pathfinder Roleplaying Game</i> to your <i>Munchkin Digital</i> mischief!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing 168 new cards, <i>Munchkin Pathfinder</i> is the first standalone set inside of <i>Munchkin Digital</i>, with more compatible <i>Pathfinder</i> content on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130930/extras/59795ad371fbe0c9dbfae886589de125.avif?t=1761750149\" width=1560 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of iconic <i>Pathfinder</i> classes like the <strong>Alchemist</strong> and the <strong>Witch</strong> to do battle with monsters like the <strong>Whispering Tyrant</strong>, <strong>Ghoul Friday</strong>, and <strong>Lamashtu, Mother of Monsters</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130930/extras/56bbed9b55ecc11df1b584268a395d5e.avif?t=1761750149\" width=1560 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like any munchkin worth their loot, you\u2019ll be killing monsters and stealing their treasure to quickly gain the most power \u2013 and along the way, you can join a faction to become an <strong>Eagle Knight</strong> or a <strong>Red Mantis Assassin</strong>, and arm yourself with the <strong>T-Bone Stake</strong> and the <strong>Armor of Insults</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges &amp; Achievements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 new Challenges, including the new <strong>Draft Challenge!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 new Achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 new Avatars!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130930/extras/86c440ec55bc75d7e60ff6ab6978d48e.avif?t=1761750149\" width=1200 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4130930?t=1761750149","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4130930?t=1761750149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130930/1083556851d7eafdeed0d075d9153ea7b368f669/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761750149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130930/1083556851d7eafdeed0d075d9153ea7b368f669/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761750149","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130930/extras/324d04de8def30cd9d1797be02a9a729.avif?t=1761750149\" width